            [
              "averne abbastanza",
              "to have had enough",
              "Ne {ip:ho} abbastanza."
            ],
            [
              "andarsene",
              "to leave",
              "Me ne {ip:vado}."
            ],
            [
              "farne a meno",
              "to do without it",
              "Non {ip:posso} farne a meno."
            ],
            [
              "valerne la pena",
              "to be worth it",
              "Ne {ip:vale} la pena."
            ],
            [
              "non poterne più",
              "not to be able to stand it",
              "Non ne {ip:posso} più!"
            ],
            [
              "infischiarsene",
              "not to care",
              "Me ne {ip:infischio}."
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "h": "With la: more fixed verbs"
      },
      "The pronoun *la* is also fixed in some verbs: *farcela* (to manage), *cavarsela* (to get by), *prendersela* (to take offence), *smetterla* (to stop it), *avercela con* (to have it in for).",
      "In the compound tenses, *la* makes the participle feminine: *Ce l'{pp:ho fatta}. Se l'{pp:è cavata}. Se l'{pp:è presa}.*"
    ]
  },
